# Tests

- Runner: Vitest + `experimental_AstroContainer` for `.astro` SSR
- Layout: `src/tests/{components,pages,utils,i18n}/**/*.test.ts`
- New component/util → add a focused unit test in the matching folder
- New page or `cv.json` project → extend `routes.test.ts` / ensure `getStaticPaths` + list hrefs cover the slug
- After `pnpm run build`, `pnpm run test:build-urls` asserts every expected file under `dist/`
- Prefer trailing-slash hrefs (`pageHref`) in assertions; avoid hard-coding only a subset of project slugs
